---
import "../../css/styles.css";
import "../../css/accessibility.css";
import "../../css/motion-narrative.css";
import "../../css/lab.css";
import MotionNarrative from "../../components/MotionNarrative.astro";
import SeoHead from "../../components/SeoHead.astro";
const siteRoot = new URL(import.meta.env.SITE);
const siteBase = new URL(import.meta.env.BASE_URL, siteRoot);
const pageUrl = new URL("lab/", siteBase);
const englishUrl = new URL("en/lab/", siteBase);
const iconUrl = new URL("assets/icons/easyki-icon.svg", siteBase);
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <SeoHead
      lang="zh-CN"
      pageUrl={pageUrl}
      alternateUrl={englishUrl}
      title="EasyKiConverter · 3D 技术实验室"
      description="独立的 STEP、网格和截面交互实验，不影响官网首页加载。"
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <header class="lab-header shell">
      <a class="brand" href={siteBase.href} aria-label="返回 EasyKiConverter 首页"><img src={iconUrl.href} alt="" width="36" height="36" /><span>EasyKiConverter <small>/ Lab</small></span></a>
      <nav aria-label="实验室导航"><a href={siteBase.href}>首页</a><a href={new URL("formats/", siteBase)}>格式矩阵</a><a href={new URL("cases/", siteBase)}>转换案例</a><a href={englishUrl}>English</a></nav>
    </header>
    <main>
      <section class="lab-intro" aria-labelledby="lab-title">
        <p class="kicker">按需加载 · EXPERIMENTAL 3D</p>
        <h1 id="lab-title">真实几何，独立实验。</h1>
        <p>这里保留 STEP、Three.js、剖面和拓扑研究能力。官网首页保持轻量，只有进入实验室时才加载 CAD/WASM 运行时。</p>
        <p class="lab-warning">实验室默认加载约 10.0 MB 桌面 GLB 或约 8.4 MB 移动 GLB；仅在模型加载失败时才启用 STEP/WASM 回退。适合桌面浏览器与技术验证；下载入口和产品信息请返回首页。</p>
        <div class="lab-intro-actions">
          <a class="button button-dark" href={siteBase.href}>返回产品首页 <span>→</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href={new URL("formats/", siteBase)}>查看格式矩阵 <span>↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>
      <MotionNarrative lang="zh" />
    </main>
    <footer class="site-footer shell"><p>© EasyKiConverter · GPL-3.0</p><a href={siteBase.href}>返回首页</a></footer>
    <script>
      import { setupModel } from "../../js/model-viewer";
      setupModel();
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
